(7783843, 1295353, 30049, '<td valign="top">
<table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> Interesting I’ve never seen a green fly before, is that green gradient?  Did you use it all over the photo?? 
<br/></i></td></tr></table>
<br/>Hi.  Thank you for the inquiry.  To answer your question, no, no gradient applied.  The fly was in the middle of an asparagus plant and there was an overcast sky, so I think there was some "glow" from the surrounding plant.  Actually, I did use some desaturation on the wings as I did notice the green cast.  Again, thanks for asking.</td>', 'Originally posted by Neat: Interesting I’ve never seen a green fly before, is that green gradient?  Did you use it all over the photo?? 

Hi.  Thank you for the inquiry.  To answer your question, no, no gradient applied.  The fly was in the middle of an asparagus plant and there was an overcast sky, so I think there was some "glow" from the surrounding plant.  Actually, I did use some desaturation on the wings as I did notice the green cast.  Again, thanks for asking.', '2025-07-02 00:30:45.000000', NULL, 0),
